# Deny-by-default allowlist.
# This repo tracks only the curated global-config files below.
# Everything else in ~/.claude/ (credentials, session history, caches,
# plugin caches, downloaded skill packages, etc.) stays untracked, even
# if new files/folders are added here later.
*

!.gitignore
!CLAUDE.md
!README.md
!AGENT-DISPATCH.md
!hooks.json
!keybindings.json
!settings.json
!skills-lock.json
!statusline-command.sh
!statusline-debug.sh

!rules/
!rules/**

!hooks/
!hooks/**
